notes.content:
Today we updated Starwalker to fix some minor issues, such as:

- Flashlight intensity increased;
- Day/Night cicle;
- Open Lock skill fixed;
- Higher dexterity helps evades enemies blows;
- All resources to build an alien ship available;

A tutorial will be added on the next update, along with the Stealth and Robots skills.

